{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"entity":1},{"site":2,"text":27,"story":33,"illustration":33,"mission":34},{"id":3,"marker":4,"kind":4,"agency":5,"nation":6,"year":7,"altitude_km":8,"inclination_deg":9,"eccentricity":10,"status":11,"surface_status":12,"samples_kg":10,"data_quality":13,"credit":14,"mission_id":3,"links":15,"fleet_refs":24},"lro","orbiter","NASA","USA",2009,50,90,0,"ACTIVE","ongoing","good","© NASA / Goddard Space Flight Center — Lunar Reconnaissance Orbiter, in orbit since 2009. LROC narrow-angle camera resolves the Apollo descent stages and Lunokhod tracks.",[16,20],{"l":17,"u":18,"t":19},"Lunar Reconnaissance Orbiter — Wikipedia","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lunar_Reconnaissance_Orbiter","intro",{"l":21,"u":22,"t":23},"LRO — NASA","https://science.nasa.gov/mission/lro/","core",[25],{"id":3,"role":26},"spacecraft",{"name":28,"mission_type":29,"site_name":30,"fact":31,"capability":32},"Lunar Reconnaissance Orbiter","活跃轨道器 · 2009 – 至今","月球极地轨道（~50 km科学阶段；2011年起椭圆轨道）","目前运行时间最长的月球轨道任务。LROC 的窄角相机能够分辨≥50 厘米的物体——分辨率足以拍摄每个 Apollo 着陆阶段、两辆 Lunokhod 月球车的轨迹，以及每个最近登陆的资产。为每次最近的月球着陆任务构建了地形和影像基础地图。目前正在绘制永久阴影撞击坑的地图，用于 Artemis 南极地点选择。","权威的现代月球侦察——为每一项最近的月球任务提供的太空眼睛。",null,{"id":3,"name":28,"first":35,"hardware":36},"有史以来分辨率最高的月球地图",[37],{"id":38,"name":39,"tagline":40},"atlas-v","Atlas V","United Launch Alliance的改进型Atlas"],"uses":{"params":["id"]}}]}
